<title>SWEDEN: Swedish industrial production up 2.3 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Swedish industrial production up 2.3 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production rose 2.3 percent in June, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION   June 96     May 96     June 95</p>
<p> Month/month (pct change)  2.3	   2.2	   2.0</p>
<p> Year/year (pct change)    4.7	   3.5	  11.1</p>
<p> Index (1990=100)	  122.0	 119.2	 117.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- Index is seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
